# ---- hiilt-marketplace ----
# A separate repository (github.com/amradel055/hiilt-marketplace), cloned here
# only for convenience. It carries its own .git, so without this entry git
# stages it as a submodule pointer and anyone who pulls gets an empty folder.
# It is not part of this project -- keep it ignored, or clone it alongside this
# repo rather than inside it.
hiilt-marketplace/
